{% block summary %}A DNS problem is suspected: lookups through the yacht's resolver fail{% if public_ok %} while a public resolver succeeds{% endif %}{% if ip_ok %}, and IP connectivity works{% endif %}.{% endblock %}
{% block causes %}
- The router's DNS service or its upstream servers are failing
- A misconfigured DNS server handed out by DHCP
- DNS filtering blocking lookups
{% endblock %}
{% block steps %}
- Check the DNS servers handed out on the LAN
- Check the router's DNS proxy settings and upstream servers
- Test a lookup directly against the router's address
{% endblock %}
{% block engineer %}Public resolver OK: {{ public_ok }}; IP connectivity OK: {{ ip_ok }}.{% endblock %}
